The legislative texts in this repository are from the Mevzuat Bilgi Sistemi, https://www.mevzuat.gov.tr, run by
T.C. Cumhurbaskanligi Hukuk ve Mevzuat Genel Mudurlugu (the Presidency of the Republic of Turkiye, Directorate
General of Law and Legislation).

Legal basis for reuse: Fikir ve Sanat Eserleri Kanunu (Law No. 5846, FSEK), article 31: "Resmen yayimlanan veya
ilan olunan kanun, Cumhurbaskanligi kararnamesi, yonetmelik, teblig, genelge ve kazai kararlarin cogaltilmasi,
yayilmasi, islenmesi veya her hangi bir suretle bunlardan faydalanma serbesttir." (The reproduction, distribution,
adaptation or any other use of officially published or announced laws, presidential decrees, regulations,
communiques, circulars and judicial decisions is free.) The exact Turkish text is in kanun/5846/madde-31.md.

The site's footer reads "Tum Haklari Saklidir" (all rights reserved) and refers to a privacy, use and copyright
notice. That notice could not be reached when the texts were retrieved (its address redirects to the home page of
www.tccb.gov.tr), so its terms were not read. The site describes the service as free of charge and unconditional
for everyone. The texts are reproduced without change to their wording; only the arrangement (one file per article,
one paragraph per line) is Lexifina's. This repository is private.

Lexifina's own contributions (tools, file arrangement, commit messages and documentation) are dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
